                     </tei:p>
                     <tei:p>Copy made for the Swedish missionary Gunnar Hermansson, Yarkand. According to f. 45 this copy was completed on the Wednesday fourth of Moharrad 1348 = June 13th 1929, in Yarkand.</tei:p>
